1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.875
Estimate before solving

2
00:00:01.875 --> 00:00:30.625
Namaste! Aaj ka lesson hai Estimate before solving. Estimate ka matlab exact jawab se pehle aas-paas ka jawab sochna hai. Is baat ko dheere-dheere samjhenge, phir ek aasaan example dekhenge. Learning mein galti hona bilkul normal hai; hum har step ko dobara check kar sakte hain.

3
00:00:30.625 --> 00:01:02.500
199 rupaye ki kitaab aur 302 rupaye ka bag milkar lagbhag 500 rupaye honge. Dhyaan do ki example mein kaunsi cheez badal rahi hai aur kaunsi same rehti hai. Pehle apna andaaza bolo, phir reason dhoondo. Agar tum kisi dost ko samjha sakte ho, to concept aur mazboot ho jaata hai.

4
00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:38.750
Har sankhya ko aasaan tens ya hundreds par round karo, estimate likho, phir exact calculation karo. Apne observation ko ek sentence mein likho. Har number ya label ke saath sahi unit ya naam lagao. Sawaal solve karte waqt jaldi mat karo; clue ko underline karo, apna tareeka chuno, aur aakhir mein jawab ko example ke saath compare karo.

